{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_049eis_1_5_049_04",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_04:1_5_049_04:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_04:1_5_049_04:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_04:1_5_049_04:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_04:1_5_049_04:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:379deb3192a12d0eb8b0ac3a506c8321a632ef693cfea2cd6a6154f7bcd8c445",
      "text": "男士衬衫模特的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_04:1_5_049_04:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4c153a4a71d5b0863d7300fbbe1f58cbb66a849343c79af04ddca7bfb49cd53",
      "text": "拍摄辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_04:1_5_049_04:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b711b67e281ffd8e7ca40bf6b8019934e6042f7ed585e1a3141afb0f7329e40",
      "text": "……不，拍摄之所以顺利，\n多亏了各位工作人员。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_04:1_5_049_04:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8dc631a35a708be2156e2dba55678e45d7d6c0219c4ce1b49c42c2f6ad2804a",
      "text": "我会努力争取能再次与大家合作。\n今天非常感谢各位。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_04:1_5_049_04:cmd-000035:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_04:1_5_049_04:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eadb7bc5a8a33dbf7c84af3790cbc0be344080c8d8620ae88297f619cd5020f5",
      "text": "锐心先生，辛苦了！\n每张照片都非常棒哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_04:1_5_049_04:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5b192ac6bd2936d3d5cf2d8f624b883e1d10319126627c26acdc916c9367b8b",
      "text": "啊。多亏了优秀的团队，\n似乎拍出了好照片。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_04:1_5_049_04:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:398af849e46f2e42c675dc902b80eb4d19adc894e162681cf203b7d1f6811819",
      "text": "全员的专业意识都很高，让我学到了很多。\n这次学到的东西，就活用到下一份工作中去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_04:1_5_049_04:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6414701d899b67f307fb6ba9a21b8dcad850b77268e825299cec958a0c9a1867",
      "text": "锐心先生无论多么顺利都不会自满，\n始终不忘谦逊的态度呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_04:1_5_049_04:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5bd0e0c5dfe579080c104586a6fafc3561e1866224b1941b29c2dd3537a81a9",
      "text": "我觉得这在与人共事时，\n是一件非常重要的品质。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_04:1_5_049_04:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:283844279f7300bcdfe267be6be8c14894d8a5f4461032c961841f6021e74552",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー，这是理所当然的吧。\n毕竟我还只是个资历尚浅的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_04:1_5_049_04:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:807dfa77c944370208114ae44952ae3490729b5e37edf4f300bf55367e8740e9",
      "text": "无论是拍摄还是做偶像，单凭一人都是无法完成的。\n今后我也不会忘记初心，继续勇往直前。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
